  "shortcuts.system.spotlight": "Spotlight",
  "@shortcuts.system.spotlight": {
    "sourceHash": "fca7aa8",
    "sameAsSourceJustification": "Apple keeps `Spotlight` in Latin in its Traditional Chinese localizations, verified rather than assumed: the Keyboard-Shortcuts table renders `Spotlight` bare and `Show Spotlight search` as `顯示Spotlight搜尋` in zh-TW, and Finder's `RV_SPOTLIGHT_ITEMS_SLICE_NAME` is `Spotlight項目` in zh-TW and zh-HK alike. This string names the macOS feature inside a conflict warning, so it must read as the user's own Keyboard settings do. Its siblings that Apple DOES localize are translated (`指揮中心`, `截圖`, `空間`)."
  },
